{
  "version": 3,
  "recordedAt": "2026-09-12",
  "note": "Screen recordings of the BuildTrack admin panel as it ships, driven by Playwright over a demo dataset (tools/demo-recorder/). One set per language: the panel chrome AND the demo content are recorded in the language of the folder, so the landing page never shows a Spanish panel to an English reader. 1280x800, silent, no narration and no editing beyond the cut. The data is invented — no real client, vendor or person appears; jobsite, client and people names are the same in both sets because proper nouns do not translate. The only dressing is the client-view link, drawn with the production host instead of the recorder's dev server (see tools/demo-recorder/support/stage.ts). Re-record: npx playwright test --config=tools/demo-recorder/recorder.config.ts clips.rec.ts && node tools/demo-recorder/encode.mjs",
